      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The glassy grain-boundary phase enhances intergranular bonding.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Silicon facilitates formation of a continuous silica-based protective oxide scale.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The silica-based scale impedes oxygen ingress.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The silica-based scale shields ZrB2 from corrosive interaction with liquid plating metals.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Silicon-doped ZrB2 processed at or below 1700 °C will have density equivalent to or better than the controls, with minimal porosity.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Silicon-doped ZrB2 will have a mechanically robust microstructure.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Silicon-doped ZrB2 will show statistically superior oxidation resistance relative to both high-temperature pure ZrB2 and lower-temperature undoped ZrB2.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Silicon-doped ZrB2 will show statistically superior liquid-metal corrosion resistance relative to both high-temperature pure ZrB2 and lower-temperature undoped ZrB2.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
